// Function Explorer -- the Inngest functions of the bot, each read from its spec.
//
// The sixth step of the site's ladder: Specs → Skills → Crons → Agents → Tools →
// Functions (t27 specs/functions/README.md calls itself "layer 5", as does
// specs/tools/README.md -- a source discrepancy recorded, not resolved here). A
// function is one `createFunction(...)` the bot 999-multibots-telegraf
// registers; its card is generated by scripts/agents-from-specs.mjs from
// specs/functions/<id>.t27 through the real compiler and witnessed by a
// vendored copy of the functions manifest (public/functions/manifest.json).
// Nothing on this page is typed twice: trigger, events, steps, retries,
// side effects, the safe probe and its result all come from the spec; the
// deployed flag comes from the manifest; and where the two disagree the card
// says so instead of picking one.
//
// LIVE STATUS is read from the bot's public status endpoint once a minute and
// never invented: when the endpoint is not there yet (404), refuses the origin
// (CORS) or is unreachable, the page draws an explicit "status source offline"
// state, and a count the endpoint did not send is shown as unknown, not zero.

